  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t21",
   "x": 1162,
   "y": 267,
   "text": "\"But then Monday\nrolls around. [...]\nyou realize that you\ndon't understand it.\nYou can't maintain it\nand you have to\nthrow most or all\nof it away.\"",
